  "question": {
    "text": "The intercepts on the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis made by tangents to the curve,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></munderover><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;which are parallel to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, are equal to&nbsp;"
  },
